<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Benue Cement Q3 profit tripples.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Benue Cement Q3 profit tripples.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter result for Benue Cement Company to end-September. (In million naira)</p>
<p>				  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Turnover		    1,700   vs   1,100</p>
<p> Profit before taxation    358.1 vs     107.1</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
